			"notes": "Minecraft **26.1–26.2** support (Fabric + NeoForge).\n\nA single build targets the deobfuscated 26.x line — compiled against 26.1 and compatible through 26.2. Entangled chests are visibly distinct from vanilla chests (custom texture + enchantment glint on the item and the placed block).\n\n### Requirements\n- **Minecraft** 26.1 or 26.2\n- **Java** 25+\n- **Architectury API** 20.0.9+ (both loaders); **Fabric API** + Fabric Loader 0.19.3+ on Fabric; **NeoForge** 26.1.2+ on NeoForge\n\n_For Minecraft 1.21.11, use the 1.1.x releases._\n\n### Notes\nNo gameplay changes — mechanics, recipes, and behaviour are identical to the 1.1.x line.\n\nDownload the jar matching your loader. Install on both client and server for multiplayer."
		},
