			"notes": "**Minecraft 1.21.11** · Fabric + NeoForge\n\nBugfix release: bounds Minecraft compatibility to the 1.21.x line so the mod no longer crashes when loaded on an incompatible Minecraft 26.x install (it now shows a clean \"requires Minecraft 1.21.11\" message instead).\n\nNo gameplay changes. **Minecraft 26.x support ships separately in 2.0.0.**\n\n### Downloads\n- `entangledchests-1.1.2-fabric.jar` — Fabric (requires Fabric API + Architectury API)\n- `entangledchests-1.1.2-neoforge.jar` — NeoForge (requires Architectury API)\n\nRequires Minecraft **1.21.11** and Java 21."
